Subject: [PATCH] Complete SkillDrive platform: compliance, telemetry, support,
 payouts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Phase 1 — Database & types
- New migration: reviews (+rating sync trigger), instructor_packages,
  lesson_telemetry, support_tickets, audit_logs (+sensitive-change
  triggers), NSW compliance fields (DI licence/WWCC/rego expiry,
  dual control), auto-suspend function for expired documents,
  learner_logbook view with the NSW 3-for-1 rule (10-lesson cap),
  role-escalation guard trigger, webhook idempotency index
- Drop unused duplicate tables from the second initial-schema migration
- Expand src/types with all new entities

Phase 2 — Edge Functions
- Shared cors + Resend email modules with branded templates
- create-checkout-session: escrow model, package support, slot-clash
  guard, server-side pricing only
- complete-lesson: commission + Stripe transfer payout on completion
- cancel-booking: 24h refund window, audit fields, emails
- reschedule-booking: self-service with conflict detection
- send-lesson-reminders (cron), send-welcome-email
- stripe-webhook: idempotent inserts, charge.refunded, stricter
  account.updated handling
- get-available-slots: fixed to use availability_slots windows
- search-instructors: postcode/suburb/rating/dual-control/package
  filters, suspended instructors excluded

Phase 3 — Frontend
- Availability editor (weekly instant-booking calendar)
- Reschedule modal, cancellation-policy messaging, mark-completed payout
- Lesson telemetry hook + route map viewer (flight-log style)
- Support ticket panel (learner/instructor) + admin ticket & audit tabs
- Real NSW logbook card with CSV export for Service NSW apps
- Dual-control / test-package search filters; welcome email on signup

Phase 4 — Tooling
- Vitest with 15 unit tests (logbook, cancellation policy, geo)
- DEPLOYMENT.md with env/secret checklist and cron setup
- Fix pre-existing tsc errors; exclude Deno functions from ESLint

